<title>UK: Sweden sets 400 million Dkr eight-year step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets 400 million Dkr eight-year step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Kredietbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KINGDOM OF SWEDEN</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKR   COUPON   **5.0	 MATURITY    11.AUG.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.764   PAY DATE    11.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA+/AA3   DENOMS (K) 10-20     SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SWEDEN    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.375     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>	    **FOR FOUR YEARS, THEN 7.25 PCT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
